cific Skills\n\nLoad individual skills as needed:\n\n```bash\ncat ~/.claude/skills/zig/zig-build-system.md\ncat ~/.claude/skills/zig/zig-c-interop.md\ncat ~/.claude/skills/zig/zig-memory-management.md\n```\n\n## Progressive Loading\n\nThis gateway skill enables progressive loading:\n- **Level 1**: Gateway loads automatically (you''re here now)\n- **Level 2**: Load category INDEX.md for full overview\n- **Level 3**: Load specific skills as needed\n\n## Usage Instructions\n\n1. **Auto-activation**: This skill loads automatically when Claude Code detects zig work\n2. **Browse skills**: Run `cat ~/.claude/skills/zig/INDEX.md` for full category overview\n3. **Load specific skills**: Use bash commands above to load individual skills\n\n---\n\n**Next Steps**: Run `cat ~/.claude/skills/zig/INDEX.md` to see full category details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:19:45.714Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Systems Programming Agents needing comprehensive Zig skills discovery and automation.","zh":"非常适合需要全面Zig技能发现和自动化的系统编程代理。","ja":"Zigスキルの総合的な発見と自動化が必要なシステムプログラミングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전반적인 Zig 스킬 발견 및 자동화가 필요한 시스템 프로그래밍 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Programación de Sistemas que necesitan un descubrimiento y automatización integral de habilidades de Zig.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Programmation de Systèmes ayant besoin d''une découverte et d''une automation complète des compétences en Zig.","de":"Perfekt für Systemprogrammierungsagenten, die eine umfassende Entdeckung und Automatisierung von Zig-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Systems Programming Agents needing comprehensive Zig skills discovery and automation.","ru":"Perfect for Systems Programming Agents needing comprehensive Zig skills discovery and automation.","ar":"Perfect for Systems Programming Agents needing comprehensive Zig skills discovery and automation."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master Zig with automatic access to skills like Zig build systems, C interop, comptime, allocators, and package management using the zon package manager, enhancing their systems programming capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理以掌握Zig的能力，通过自动访问诸如Zig构建系统、C互操作性、编译时、分配器和使用zon包管理器的包管理等技能，从而增强其系统编程能力。","ja":"エージェントがZigをマスターする能力を付与し、Zigのビルドシステム、Cの相互運用性、コンパイル時、割り当て、zonパッケージマネージャーを使用したパッケージ管理などのスキルに自動的にアクセスすることで、システムプログラミングの能力を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 Zig을 마스터할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Zig 빌드 시스템, C 상호 운용성, 컴파일 타임, 할당자 및 zon 패키지 관리자를 사용한 패키지 관리와 같은 스킬에 자동으로 액세스하여 시스템 프로그래밍 기능을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar Zig con acceso automático a habilidades como sistemas de compilación de Zig, interop de C, comptime, asignadores de memoria y gestión de paquetes utilizando el administrador de paquetes zon, mejorando sus capacidades de programación de sistemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser Zig avec un accès automatique à des compétences comme les systèmes de construction de Zig, l''interop de C, comptime, les allocateurs de mémoire et la gestion de paquets à l''aide du gestionnaire de paquets zon, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de programmation de systèmes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Zig mit automatischem Zugriff auf Fähigkeiten wie Zig-Build-Systeme, C-Interop, comptime, Speicherzuweiser und Paketverwaltung mithilfe des Paketmanagers zon zu meistern, wodurch ihre Systemprogrammierfähigkeiten verbessert werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to master Zig with automatic access to skills like Zig build systems, C interop, comptime, allocators, and package management using the zon package manager, enhancing their systems programming capabilities.","ru":"Empowers agents to master Zig with automatic access to skills like Zig build systems, C interop, comptime, allocators, and package management using the zon package manager, enhancing their systems programming capabilities.","ar":"Empowers agents to master Zig with automatic access to skills like Zig build systems, C interop, comptime, allocators, and package management using the zon package manager, enhancing their 