s à Zig"],"de":["Benötigt eine Zig-Programmiersprachumgebung","Begrenzt auf Systemprogrammierung und Zig-bezogene Aufgaben"],"pt":["Requires Zig programming language environment","Limited to systems programming and Zig-related tasks"],"ru":["Requires Zig programming language environment","Limited to systems programming and Zig-related tasks"],"ar":["Requires Zig programming language environment","Limited to systems programming and Zig-related tasks"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a8eee673a13f10abfda7b0325808ae7698044404b2abe685ca8c716f51d5bc7c","qualityScore":49}');
