ls zur Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit Abstimmungsplattformen","Detaillierte Berichte und Analysen"],"pt":["Análise de ponto de entrada de aplicativos","Otimização de código para melhor performance","Detecção de vulnerabilidades de segurança","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Relatórios detalhados de análise"],"ru":["Анализ точки входа приложений","Оптимизация кода для лучшей производительности","Обнаружение уязвимостей безопасности","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Подробные отчеты анализа"],"ar":["تحليل نقطة الدخول لتطبيقات","تحسين الكود لتحقيق أداء أفضل","اكتشاف ثغرات أمنية","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير شائعة","تقارير مفصلة للتحليل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","入口分析器","代码优化","React开发","Node.js开发","CLI工具","如何使用entry-point-analyzer","entry-point-analyzer安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","エントリーポイント分析ツール","コード最適化","React開発","Node.js開発","CLIツール","entry-point-analyzerの使い方","entry-point-analyzerのインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","入口점 분석기","코드 최적화","React 개발","Node.js 개발","CLI 도구","entry-point-analyzer 사용법","entry-point-analyzer 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es un analizador de punto de entrada","alternativas a herramientas de votación","herramientas de IA para votación","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","quoi est un analyseur de point d''entrée","alternatives aux outils de vote","outils d''IA pour vote","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration d''outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Eintragspunktanalyzer","Alternativen zu Abstimmungstools","KI-Tools für Abstimmung","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","analisador de ponto de entrada","otimização de código","segurança de aplicativos","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","como usar analisador de ponto de entrada","analisador de ponto de entrada vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","анализатор точки входа","оптимизация кода","безопасность приложений","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","как использовать анализ точки входа","анализатор точки входа vs другие инструменты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","محلل نقطة الدخول","تحسين الكود","أمان التطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","كيفية استخدام محلل نقطة الدخول","محلل نقطة الدخول مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"andrescardonas7","repo":"salchipapa-web","repoPath":"andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.819Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"entry-point-analyzer","description":"Analyzes smart contract codebases to identify state-changing entry points for security auditing. Detects externally callable functions that modify state, categorizes them by access level (public, admin, role-restricted, contract-only), and generates structured audit reports. Excludes view/pure/read-only functions. Use when auditing smart contracts (Solidity, Vyper, Solana/Rust, Move, TON, CosmWasm) or when asked to find entry points, audit flows, external functions, access control patterns, or privileged operations.","bodyPreview":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract st","body":"# Entry Point Analyzer\n\nSystematically identify all **state-changing** entry points in a smart contract codebase to guide security audits.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Starting a smart contract security audit to map the attack surface\n- Asked to find entry points, external functions, or audit flows\n- Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase\n- Identifying privileged operations and role-restricted functions\n- Building an understanding of which functions can modify contract state\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\nDo NOT use this skill for:\n- Vulnerability detection (use audit-context-building or domain-specific-audits)\n- Writing exploit POCs (use solidity-poc-builder)\n- Code quality or gas optimization analysis\n- Non-smart-contract codebases\n- Analyzing read-only functions (this skill excludes them)\n\n## Scope: State-Changing Functions Only\n\nThis skill focuses exclusively on functions that can modify state. **Excluded:**\n\n| Language | Excluded Patterns |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| Solidity | `view`, `pure` functions |\n| Vyper | `@view`, `@pure` functions |\n| Solana | Functions without `mut` account references |\n| Move | Non-entry `public fun` (module-callable only) |\n| TON | `get` methods (FunC), read-only receivers (Tact) |\n| CosmWasm | `query` entry point and its handlers |\n\n**Why exclude read-only functions?** They cannot directly cause loss of funds or state corruption. While they may leak information, the primary audit focus is on functions that can change state.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Detect Language** - Identify contract language(s) from file extensions and syntax\n2. **Use Tooling (if available)** - For Solidity, check if Slither is available and use it\n3. **Locate Contracts** - Find all contract/module files (apply directory filter if specified)\n4. **Extract Entry Points** - Parse each file for externally callable, state-changing functions\n5. **Classify Access** - Categorize each function by access level\n6. **Generate Report** - Output structured markdown report\n\n## Slither Integration (Solidity)\n\nFor Solidity codebases, Slither can automatically extract entry points. Before manual analysis:\n\n### 1. Check if Slither is Available\n\n```bash\nwhich slither\n```\n\n### 2. If Slither is Detected, Run Entry Points Printer\n\n```bash\nslither . --print entry-points\n```\n\nThis outputs a table of all state-changing entry points with:\n- Contract name\n- Function name\n- Visibility\n- Modifiers applied\n\n### 3. Use Slither Output as Foundation\n\n- Parse the Slither output table to populate your analysis\n- Cross-reference with manual inspection for access control classification\n- Slither may miss some patterns (callbacks, dynamic access control)—supplement with manual review\n- If Slither fails (compilation errors, unsupported features), fall back to manual analysis\n\n### 4. When Slither is NOT Available\n\nIf `which slither` returns nothing, proceed with manual analysis using the language-specific reference files.\n\n## Language Detection\n\n| Extension | Language | Reference |\n|-----------|----------|-----------|\n| `.sol` | Solidity | [{baseDir}/references/solidity.md]({baseDir}/references/solidity.md) |\n| `.vy` | Vyper | [{baseDir}/references/vyper.md]({baseDir}/references/vyper.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `solana-program` | Solana (Rust) | [{baseDir}/references/solana.md]({baseDir}/references/solana.md) |\n| `.move` | Move (Aptos/Sui) | [{baseDir}/references/move.md]({baseDir}/references/move.md) |\n| `.fc`, `.func`, `.tact` | TON (FunC/Tact) | [{baseDir}/references/ton.md]({baseDir}/references/ton.md) |\n| `.rs` + `Cargo.toml` with `cosmwasm-std` | CosmWasm | [{baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md]({baseDir}/references/cosmwasm.md) |\n\nLoad the appropriate reference file(s) based on detected language before analysis.\n\n## Access Classification\n\nClassify each state-changing entry point into one of these categories:\n\n### 1. Public (Unrestricted)\nFunctions callable by anyone without restrictions.\n\n### 2. Role-Restricted\nFunctions limited to specific roles. Common patterns to detect:\n- Explicit role names: `admin`, `owner`, `governance`, `guardian`, `operator`, `manager`, `minter`, `pauser`, `keeper`, `relayer`, `lender`, `borrower`\n- Role-checking patterns: `onlyRole`, `hasRole`, `require(msg.sender == X)`, `assert_owner`, `#[access_control]`\n- When role is ambiguous, flag as **\"Restricted (review required)\"** with the restriction pattern noted\n\n### 3. Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\nFunctions callable only by other contracts, not by EOAs. Indicators:\n- Callbacks: `onERC721Received`, `uniswapV3SwapCallback`, `flashLoanCallback`\n- Interface implementations with contract-caller checks\n- Functions that revert if `tx.origin == msg.sender`\n- Cross-contract hooks\n\n## Output Format\n\nGenerate a markdown report with this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Entry Point Analysis: [Project Name]\n\n**Analyzed**: [timestamp]\n**Scope**: [directories analyzed or \"full codebase\"]\n**Languages**: [detected languages]\n**Focus**: State-changing functions only (view/pure excluded)\n\n## Summary\n\n| Category | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| Public (Unrestricted) | X |\n| Role-Restricted | X |\n| Restricted (Review Required) | X |\n| Contract-Only | X |\n| **Total** | **X** |\n\n---\n\n## Public Entry Points (Unrestricted)\n\nState-changing functions callable by anyone—prioritize for attack surface analysis.\n\n| Function | File | Notes |\n|----------|------|-------|\n| `functionName(params)` | `path/to/file.sol:L42` | Brief note if relevant |\n\n---\n\n## Role-Restricted Entry Points\n\n### Admin / Owner\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| `setFee(uint256)` | `Config.sol:L15` | `onlyOwner` |\n\n### Governance\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Guardian / Pauser\n| Function | File | Restriction |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n\n### Other Roles\n| Function | File | Restriction | Role |\n|----------|------|-------------|------|\n\n---\n\n## Restricted (Review Required)\n\nFunctions with access control patterns that need manual verification.\n\n| Function | File | Pattern | Why Review |\n|----------|------|---------|------------|\n| `execute(bytes)` | `Executor.sol:L88` | `require(trusted[msg.sender])` | Dynamic trust list |\n\n---\n\n## Contract-Only (Internal Integration Points)\n\nFunctions only callable by other contracts—useful for understanding trust boundaries.\n\n| Function | File | Expected Caller |\n|----------|------|-----------------|\n| `onFlashLoan(...)` | `Vault.sol:L200` | Flash loan provider |\n\n---\n\n## Files Analyzed\n\n- `path/to/file1.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n- `path/to/file2.sol` (X state-changing entry points)\n```\n\n## Filtering\n\nWhen user specifies a directory filter:\n- Only analyze files within that path\n- Note the filter in the report header\n- Example: \"Analyze only `src/core/`\" → scope = `src/core/`\n\n## Analysis Guidelines\n\n1. **Be thorough**: Don''t skip files. Every state-changing externally callable function matters.\n2. **Be conservative**: When uncertain about access level, flag for review rather than miscategorize.\n3. **Skip read-only**: Exclude `view`, `pure`, and equivalent read-only functions.\n4. **Note inheritance**: If a function''s access control comes from a parent contract, note this.\n5. **Track modifiers**: List all access-related modifiers/decorators applied to each function.\n6. **Identify patterns**: Look for common patterns like:\n   - Initializer functions (often unrestricted on first call)\n   - Upgrade functions (high-privilege)\n   - Emergency/pause functions (guardian-level)\n   - Fee/parameter setters (admin-level)\n   - Token transfers and approvals (often public)\n\n## Common Role Patterns by Protocol Type\n\n| Protocol Type | Common Roles |\n|---------------|--------------|\n| DEX | `owner`, `feeManager`, `pairCreator` |\n| Lending | `admin`, `guardian`, `liquidator`, `oracle` |\n| Governance | `proposer`, `executor`, `canceller`, `timelock` |\n| NFT | `minter`, `admin`, `royaltyReceiver` |\n| Bridge | `relayer`, `guardian`, `validator`, `operator` |\n| Vault/Yield | `strategist`, `keeper`, `harvester`, `manager` |\n\n## Rationalizations to Reject\n\nWhen analyzing entry points, reject these shortcuts:\n- \"This function looks standard\" → Still classify it; standard functions can have non-standard access control\n- \"The modifier name is clear\" → Verify the modifier''s actual implementation\n- \"This is obviously admin-only\" → Trace the actual restriction; \"obvious\" assumptions miss subtle bypasses\n- \"I''ll skip the callbacks\" → Callbacks define trust boundaries; always include them\n- \"It doesn''t modify much state\" → Any state change can be exploited; include all non-view functions\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf a file cannot be parsed:\n1. Note it in the report under \"Analysis Warnings\"\n2. Continue with remaining files\n3. Suggest manual review for unparsable files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:37:55.052Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Smart Contract Agents needing advanced security audit capabilities to identify state-changing entry points.","zh":"非常适合需要高级安全审计能力来识别状态更改入口的智能合约代理。","ja":"高度なセキュリティ監査機能を必要とするスマートコントラクトエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 보안 감사 기능이 필요한 스마트 계약 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Contrato Inteligente que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de seguridad avanzadas para identificar puntos de entrada que cambian el estado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contrat intelligent nécessitant des capacités d''audit de sécurité avancées pour identifier les points d''entrée qui modifient l''état.","de":"Perfekt für Smart-Contract-Agents, die erweiterte Sicherheitsauditfunktionen benötigen, um staatändernde Eintrittspunkte zu identifizieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Contrato Inteligente que precisam de capacidades avançadas de auditoria de segurança para identificar pontos de entrada que alteram o estado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов умных контрактов, требующих расширенных возможностей аудита безопасности для выявления точек входа, изменяющих состояние.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء العقدين الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتدقيق الأمني لتحديد نقاط الدخول التي تغير الحالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically identify vulnerabilities in smart contract codebases by mapping attack surfaces, analyzing access control patterns, and detecting privileged operations using techniques like external function identification and audit flow analysis.","zh":"赋予代理系统地识别智能合约代码库中的漏洞的能力，通过映射攻击面、分析访问控制模式并使用外部函数识别和审计流分析等技术来检测特权操作。","ja":"スマートコントラクトコードベース内の脆弱性を体系的に識別するエージェントの能力を与えます。攻撃面のマッピング、访问制御パターンの分析、外部関数識別や監査フロー分析などの技術を使用して、特権操作を検出します。","ko":"스마트 계약 코드베이스 내의 취약성을 체계적으로 식별 할 수있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다. 공격 표면 매핑, 접근 제어 패턴 분석 및 외부 함수 식별 및 감사 흐름 분석などの 기술을 사용하여 특권 연산을 감지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar sistemáticamente vulnerabilidades en codebases de contrato inteligente mediante el mapeo de superficies de ataque, el análisis de patrones de control de acceso y la detección de operaciones privilegiadas utilizando técnicas como la identificación de funciones externas y el análisis de flujo de auditoría.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier systématiquement les vulnérabilités dans les codebases de contrat intelligent en cartographiant les surfaces d''attaque, en analysant les modèles de contrôle d''accès et en détectant les opérations privilégiées en utilisant des techniques comme l''identification de fonctions externes et l''analyse de flux d''audit.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Schwachstellen in Smart-Contract-Codebasen systematisch zu identifizieren, indem sie Angriffsoberflächen kartieren, Zugriffskontrollmuster analysieren und privilegierte Operationen mithilfe von Techniken wie externer Funktionsidentifizierung und Audit-Flussanalyse erkennen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar sistematicamente vulnerabilidades no código da base de código do contrato inteligente, mapeando superfícies de ataque, analisando padrões de controle de acesso e detectando operações privilegiadas usando técnicas como identificação de funções externas e análise de fluxo de auditoria.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически выявлять уязвимости в кодовой базе умного контракта, отображая поверхности атаки, анализируя шаблоны контроля доступа и обнаруживая привилегированные операции с помощью методов, таких как определение внешних функций и анализ потока аудита.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد الثغرات أسلوبا منهجيا في قاعدة الشفرة للعقد الذكي عن طريق رسم سطوح الهجوم وتحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول واكتشاف العمليات المميزة باستخدام تقنيات مثل تحديد الدوال الخارجية وتحليل تدفق التدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating smart contract security audits to identify potential entry points","Analyzing access control patterns across a codebase to detect role-restricted functions","Identifying privileged operations to guide security assessments"],"zh":["自动化智能合约安全审计以识别潜在入口点","分析代码库中的访问控制模式以检测角色限制函数","识别特权操作以指导安全评估"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのセキュリティ監査を自動化して潜在的なエントリーポイントを識別する","コードベース内のアクセス制御パターンを分析して役割制限関数を検出する","特権操作を識別してセキュリティ評価を導く"],"ko":["스마트 계약 보안 감사를 자동화하여 잠재적인 진입점을 식별하는 것","코드베이스 전반의 접근 제어 패턴을 분석하여 역할 제한 함수를 감지하는 것","특권 연산을 식별하여 보안 평가를 안내하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de seguridad de contrato inteligente para identificar posibles puntos de entrada","Analizar patrones de control de acceso en toda la base de código para detectar funciones restringidas por roles","Identificar operaciones privilegiadas para guiar evaluaciones de seguridad"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de sécurité de contrat intelligent pour identifier les points d''entrée potentiels","Analyser les modèles de contrôle d''accès dans l''ensemble de la base de code pour détecter les fonctions restreintes par rôle","Identifier les opérations privilégiées pour guider les évaluations de sécurité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für Smart-Contracts, um potenzielle Eintrittspunkte zu identifizieren","Analyse von Zugriffskontrollmustern im gesamten Codebase, um rollenbeschränkte Funktionen zu erkennen","Identifizierung von privilegierten Operationen, um Sicherheitsbewertungen zu leiten"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança de contrato inteligente para identificar pontos de entrada potenciais","Analizar padrões de controle de acesso em toda a base de código para detectar funções restritas por papel","Identificar operações privilegiadas para orientar avaliações de segurança"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудит безопасности умного контракта для выявления потенциальных точек входа","Анализировать шаблоны контроля доступа на всей кодовой базе для обнаружения функций, ограниченных по ролям","Выявлять привилегированные операции для руководства оценками безопасности"],"ar":["تحويل تدقيق أمان العقد الذكي إلى عمليات آلية لتحديد نقاط الدخول المحتملة","تحليل أنماط التحكم في الوصول في جميع أنحاء قاعدة الشفرة لاكتشاف الدوال المقيدة بالدور","تحديد العمليات المميزة لتوجيه التقييمات الأمنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to smart contract codebase","Limited to security audit use cases","May require additional configuration for complex contract architectures"],"zh":["需要访问智能合约代码库","仅限安全审计用例","可能需要为复杂的合约架构进行额外配置"],"ja":["スマートコントラクトのコードベースへのアクセスが必要","セキュリティ監査用途のみ","複雑なコントラクトアーキテクチャの場合、追加の構成が必要になる可能性あり"],"ko":["스마트 계약 코드베이스에 대한 접근 권한이 필요합니다.","보안 감사 용례에만 제한됩니다.","복잡한 계약 아키텍처의 경우 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código del contrato inteligente","Limitado a casos de uso de auditoría de seguridad","Puede requerir configuración adicional para arquitecturas de contrato complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code du contrat intelligent","Limité aux cas d''utilisation d''audit de sécurité","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des architectures de contrat complexes"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis des Smart-Contracts","Begrenzt auf Sicherheitsaudit-Anwendungsfälle","Kann für komplexe Vertragsarchitekturen zusätzliche Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Exige acesso à base de código do contrato inteligente","Limitado a casos de uso de auditoria de segurança","Pode exigir configuração adicional para arquiteturas de contrato complexas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе умного контракта","Ограничен случаями использования аудита безопасности","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для сложных архитектур контрактов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للعقد الذكي","محدود bằng حالات استخدام تدقيق الأمان","قد يحتاج إلى تكوين إضافي لعمارة عقود معقدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"30ee63ad5132dbfd760a86d0b5e626299c297100bc6d2fc7ca0a93ce037cbb02","qualityScore":49}');
