d-native","architecture propre pour applications haute performance"],"de":[".NET Core-Experte","Entwicklung von .NET-Anwendungen","minimale APIs mit .NET 8","C# 12 für skalierbare Anwendungen","Entity Framework Core","cloud-native Anwendungs-Muster","saubere Architektur für hochleistungs-Anwendungen"],"pt":["dotnet core expert","desenvolvimento de aplicações .NET 8","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","aplicações nativas de nuvem","APIs mínimas .NET 8","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologias de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент .NET Core Expert","разработка приложений на основе .NET 8","C# 12","Entity Framework Core","облачные приложения","минимальные API .NET 8","разработка программного обеспечения","технологии разработки"],"ar":["خبير كور نت","تنمية التطبيقات باستخدام .NET 8","سي شارب 12","Entity Framework Core","التطبيقات الأصلية السحابية","واجهات برمجة تطبيقات минимية مع .NET 8","تنمية البرمجيات","تقنيات التنمية"]}},"owner":"aq-uua","repo":"APPSECURITY2ASSN","repoPath":"aq-uua/APPSECURITY2ASSN","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.635Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T02:15:29.521Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Native Agents needing advanced .NET Core development capabilities for building high-performance, scalable applications.","zh":"适合需要高级 .NET Core 开发能力的云原生代理，用于构建高性能、可扩展的应用程序。","ja":".NET Core の高度な開発機能を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適で、高パフォーマンスでスケーラブルなアプリケーションを構築する。","ko":".NET Core의 고급 개발 기능이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고성능 및 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Cloud-Native que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo avanzadas de .NET Core para construir aplicaciones de alto rendimiento y escalables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud-Native qui ont besoin de capacités de développement avancées .NET Core pour construire des applications hautes performances et évolutives.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die erweiterte .NET Core-Entwicklungsfunktionen für den Bau von hochleistungs- und skalierbaren Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloud-Native que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento .NET Core para construir aplicações de alto desempenho e escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Cloud-Native агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки .NET Core для создания высокопроизводительных и масштабируемых приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من تنمية .NET Core لإنشاء تطبيقات عالية الأداء وقابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build cloud-native applications using .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and Entity Framework Core, enabling the creation of high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.","zh":"使代理能够使用 .NET 8、现代 C#、最小 API 和 Entity Framework Core 构建云原生应用程序，从而能够创建高性能、可扩展的应用程序且具有干净的架构。","ja":".NET 8、モダンC#、最小API、Entity Framework Core を使用してクラウドネイティブ アプリケーションを構築できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、高パフォーマンスでスケーラブルなアプリケーションをクリーンなアーキテクチャで作成可能にします。","ko":".NET 8, 최신 C#, 최소 API 및 Entity Framework Core를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 에이전트를 Empower하여, 높은 성능 및 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 깨끗한 아키텍처로 생성할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones cloud-native utilizando .NET 8, C# moderno, APIs mínimas y Entity Framework Core, lo que permite la creación de aplicaciones de alto rendimiento y escalables con arquitectura limpia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications cloud-native en utilisant .NET 8, C# moderne, des API minimales et Entity Framework Core, permettant ainsi la création d''applications hautes performances et évolutives avec une architecture propre.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, cloud-native Anwendungen mit .NET 8, modernem C#, minimalen APIs und Entity Framework Core zu erstellen, wodurch die Erstellung von hochleistungs- und skalierbaren Anwendungen mit sauberer Architektur ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações cloud-native usando .NET 8, C# moderno, APIs minimas e Entity Framework Core, permitindo a criação de aplicações de alto desempenho e escaláveis com arquitetura limpa.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать облачные приложения с использованием .NET 8, современного C#, минималных API и Entity Framework Core, что позволяет создавать высокопроизводительные и масштабируемые приложения с чистой архитектурой.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات الأصليين السحابة باستخدام .NET 8 واللغة C# الحديثة وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات المُ缩رة و Entity Framework Core، وتمكين إنشاء تطبيقات عالية الأداء وقابلة للتوسيع مع هندسة نظيفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building minimal APIs with .NET 8 for enterprise applications","Developing cloud-native applications using C# 12 and Entity Framework Core","Designing clean architecture for scalable and maintainable .NET Core applications"],"zh":["使用 .NET 8 为企业应用程序构建最小 API","使用 C# 12 和 Entity Framework Core 开发云原生应用程序","为可扩展且可维护的 .NET Core 应用程序设计干净的架构"],"ja":["エンタープライズ アプリケーションのための .NET 8 を使用した最小 API の構築","C# 12 と Entity Framework Core を使用したクラウドネイティブ アプリケーションの開発","スケーラブルでメンテナンス可能な .NET Core アプリケーションのためのクリーンなアーキテクチャの設計"],"ko":[".NET 8을 사용하여 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션을 위한 최소 API 구축","C# 12 및 Entity Framework Core를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 .NET Core 애플리케이션을 위한 깨끗한 아키텍처 설계"],"es":["Construcción de APIs mínimas con .NET 8 para aplicaciones empresariales","Desarrollo de aplicaciones cloud-native utilizando C# 12 y Entity Framework Core","Diseño de arquitectura limpia para aplicaciones .NET Core escalables y mantenibles"],"fr":["Conception d''API minimales avec .NET 8 pour des applications d''entreprise","Développement d''applications cloud-native en utilisant C# 12 et Entity Framework Core","Conception d''une architecture propre pour des applications .NET Core évolutives et maintenables"],"de":["Erstellung von minimalen APIs mit .NET 8 für Unternehmensanwendungen","Entwicklung von cloud-native Anwendungen mit C# 12 und Entity Framework Core","Entwurf einer sauberen Architektur für skalierbare und wartbare .NET Core-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Construção de APIs minimas com .NET 8 para aplicações empresariais","Desenvolvimento de aplicações cloud-native usando C# 12 e Entity Framework Core","Projeto de arquitetura limpa para aplicações .NET Core escaláveis e manteniveis"],"ru":["Создание минималных API с использованием .NET 8 для корпоративных приложений","Разработка облачных приложений с использованием C# 12 и Entity Framework Core","Проектирование чистой архитектуры для масштабируемых и поддерживаемых приложений .NET Core"],"ar":["بناء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المُ缩رة باستخدام .NET 8 لتطبيقات الشركات","تطوير تطبيقات الأصليين السحابة باستخدام C# 12 و Entity Framework Core","تصميم هندسة نظيفة لتطبيقات .NET Core القابلة للتوسيع والصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 8 and C# 12 compatibility","Limited to cloud-native application development","Entity Framework Core required for database operations"],"zh":["需要 .NET 8 和 C# 12 兼容性","仅限云原生应用程序开发","需要 Entity Framework Core 进行数据库操作"],"ja":[".NET 8 と C# 12 の互換性が必要","クラウドネイティブ アプリケーションの開発に限定","データベース操作には Entity Framework Core が必要"],"ko":[".NET 8 및 C# 12 호환성이 필요합니다","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에만 국한","데이터베이스 작업을 위해 Entity Framework Core가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con .NET 8 y C# 12","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones cloud-native","Se requiere Entity Framework Core para operaciones de base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec .NET 8 et C# 12","Limité au développement d''applications cloud-native","Entity Framework Core est requis pour les opérations de base de données"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit .NET 8 und C# 12","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von cloud-native Anwendungen","Entity Framework Core wird für Datenbankoperationen benötigt"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com .NET 8 e C# 12","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações cloud-native","Entity Framework Core necessário para operações de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требуется совместимость с .NET 8 и C# 12","Ограничен разработкой облачных приложений","Entity Framework Core необходим для операций с базами данных"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقا مع .NET 8 و C# 12","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات الأصليين السحابة","Entity Framework Core مطلوب لعمليات قواعد البيانات"]},"version":4},"cont