INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('aq-uua/APPSECURITY2ASSN/dotnet-core-expert', 'dotnet-core-expert', 'aq-uua', 'APPSECURITY2ASSN', 'community', 'dotnet-core-expert aq-uua APPSECURITY2ASSN community The dotnet-core-expert skill provides senior .NET Core specialists with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, and cloud-native application development. Benefits enterprise application developers. .NET Core 专家技能涵盖 .NET 8、C# 12、最小 API 和云原生应用开发。适用于构建高性能、可扩展的企业应用 .NET Core エキスパートスキルは、.NET 8、C# 12、最小 API、クラウドネイティブ アプリケーション開発をカバーします。高性能な拡張可能なエンタープライズ アプリケーションを構築するために適しています .NET Core 전문가 스킬은 .NET 8, C# 12, 최소 API, 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발을 다룹니다. 높은 성능과 확장 가능한 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 적합합니다 El experto en .NET Core es un especialista senior en .NET 8, C# 12 y patrones de aplicaciones nativas de la nube L''expert .NET Core est un spécialiste senior en .NET 8, C# 12 et modèles d''applications cloud-native Der .NET Core-Experte ist ein Senior-Spezialist für .NET 8, C# 12 und cloud-native Anwendungs-Muster O .NET Core Expert é um especialista sênior em .NET 8, C# 12 e desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas de nuvem. Fornece habilidades para construir aplicações escaláveis e de alto desempenho ИИ Агент .NET Core Expert - это высококвалифицированный специалист в области .NET 8, C# 12 и разработки облачных приложений. Предоставляет навыки для создания масштабируемых и высокопроизводительных приложений خبير كور نت هو خبير مسن في .NET 8 وسي شارب 12 وتنمية التطبيقات الأصلية السحابية. يوفر مهارات لإنشاء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع وأداء عالي dotnet-core-expert setup guide what is dotnet-core-expert dotnet-core-expert vs .NET framework how to use dotnet-core-expert for cloud-native development dotnet-core-expert install for Windows dotnet-core-expert alternative for enterprise applications dotnet-core-expert tutorial for minimal APIs dotnet-core-expert best practices for high-performance applications dotnet-core-expert documentation for C# 12 dotnet-core-expert examples for Entity Framework Core .NET Core 专家 .NET 8 开发 C# 12 教程 最小 API 构建 云原生应用开发 Entity Framework Core 高性能应用设计 Builds high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture Develops minimal APIs with .NET 8 Utilizes Entity Framework Core for data access Applies cloud-native patterns for enterprise applications Supports C# 12 for modern .NET development Creates cloud-native applications with .NET 8 dotnet-core-expert is a senior .NET Core specialist with expertise in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.');
