","NET 8","C# 12","APIs minimalistes","Entity Framework Core","modèles d''application cloud","outils de développement d''applications"],"de":["dotnet core expert","Entwicklung von Cloud-Anwendungen","NET 8","C# 12","minimalistische APIs","Entity Framework Core","Cloud-Anwendungs-Muster","Entwicklungstools für Anwendungen"],"pt":["dotnet core expert","desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis","minimal APIs","Entity Framework Core","cloud-native patterns","C# 12","NET 8","arquitetura de aplicativos","desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem"],"ru":["ИИ Агент .NET Core Expert","разработка масштабируемых приложений","минимальные API","Entity Framework Core","cloud-native patterns","C# 12","NET 8","архитектура приложений","разработка облачных приложений"],"ar":["خبير النيت كور","تطوير التطبيقات القابلة للتوسعة","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المحدودة","Entity Framework Core","أنماط السحابة الأصلية","سي شارب 12","النيت 8","هندسة التطبيقات","تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية في السحابة"]}},"owner":"phidvss55","repo":".net10","repoPath":"phidvss55/.net10","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.635Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T02:15:31.225Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud-Native Agents needing high-performance .NET application development expertise.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能的基于云的.NET应用程序开发专业知识的代理。","ja":"クラウドネイティブエージェントが高性能の.NETアプリケーション開発の専門知識を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고성능의 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트가 .NET 애플리케이션 개발 전문 지식을 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Cloud-Native que necesitan experiencia en desarrollo de aplicaciones .NET de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud-Native qui ont besoin d''expertise en développement d''applications .NET haute performance.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Native-Agents, die Expertenwissen im Bereich Entwicklung von .NET-Anwendungen mit hoher Leistung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cloud-Native que precisam de expertise em desenvolvimento de aplicativos .NET de alto desempenho.","ru":"Идеально для Cloud-Native агентов, которым необходима экспертиза в области разработки высокопроизводительных приложений .NET.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تطوير تطبيقات .NET عالية الأداء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable applications with .NET 8, leveraging modern C#, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns for optimized enterprise software development.","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展应用程序的能力，利用.NET 8、现代C#、最小API、Entity Framework Core和面向优化企业软件开发的云原生模式。","ja":".NET 8、モダンC#、ミニマルAPI、Entity Framework Core、および最適化されたエンタープライズソフトウェア開発のためのクラウドネイティブパターンを利用して、エージェントがスケーラブルなアプリケーションを構築できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 .NET 8, 최신 C#, 최소한의 API, Entity Framework Core 및 최적화된 엔터프라이즈 소프트웨어 개발을 위한 클라우드 네이티브 패턴을 사용하여 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones escalables con .NET 8, aprovechando el C# moderno, las API mínimas, Entity Framework Core y patrones cloud-nativos para un desarrollo de software empresarial optimizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications escalables avec .NET 8, en exploitant le C# moderne, les API minimales, Entity Framework Core et les modèles cloud-natifs pour un développement de logiciels d''entreprise optimisé.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, mit .NET 8 skalierbare Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie modernes C#, minimale APIs, Entity Framework Core und cloud-native Muster für optimierte Unternehmenssoftware-Entwicklung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações escaláveis com .NET 8, aproveitando o C# moderno, APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core e padrões de desenvolvimento de software de empresa nativos em nuvem para desenvolvimento de software de empresa otimizado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые приложения с помощью .NET 8, используя современный C#, минимальные API, Entity Framework Core и облачные модели для оптимизации разработки корпоративного программного обеспечения.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة باستخدام .NET 8، واستخدام لغة C# الحديثة وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات المُقلصة وEntity Framework Core وأنماط البرامج السحابية الأصلية لتطوير البرامج Enterprises المُحسّنة."},"useCases":{"en":[