INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('flet-dev/flet/prepare-flet-release', 'prepare-flet-release', 'flet-dev', 'flet', 'community', 'prepare-flet-release flet-dev flet community android cross-platform desktop flutter ios python server-driven-ui web The prepare-flet-release skill automates Flet versioning for developers, enabling easy build and release of real-time web, mobile, and desktop apps in Python. It benefits developers by simplifying the release process. Flet 发布准备技能自动化 Flet 项目的版本更新和发布过程，支持 Python 语言。该技能可以自动更新版本号、刷新依赖项和生成变更日志。 Flet リリース準備スキルは、Flet プロジェクトのバージョン更新とリリースプロセスを自動化します。Python 言語をサポートし、バージョン番号の更新、依存関係の更新、変更ログの生成などを行います。 Flet 릴리즈 준비 스킬은 Flet 프로젝트의 버전 업데이트 및 릴리즈 프로세스를 자동화합니다. Python 언어를 지원하며 버전 번호 업데이트와 의존성 갱신 및 변경 로그 생성 등을 수행합니다. Prepare-flet-release es una herramienta que permite a los desarrolladores configurar fácilmente sus proyectos Flet para crear aplicaciones web, móviles y de escritorio en Python Prepare-flet-release est un outil qui permet aux développeurs de configurer facilement leurs projets Flet pour créer des applications web, mobiles et de bureau en Python Prepare-flet-release ist ein Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihre Flet-Projekte einfach zu konfigurieren, um Web-, Mobile- und Desktop-Anwendungen in Python zu erstellen O prepare-flet-release permite que desenvolvedores criem aplicações em Python sem experiência em frontend. Ele automatiza a atualização da versão do Flet e gera um novo registro de alterações. Prepare-flet-release позволяет разработчикам создавать приложения на Python без опыта в frontend. Он автоматизирует обновление версии Flet и генерирует новый журнал изменений. يسمح prepare-flet-release للمطورين بإنشاء تطبيقات بايثون بدون خبرة في واجهة المستخدم. ي自动 تحديث إصدار Flet وينشئ سجل تعديلات جديد how to use prepare-flet-release prepare-flet-release setup guide Flet versioning automation prepare-flet-release alternative prepare-flet-release vs manual versioning prepare-flet-release install automated Flet release process prepare-flet-release tutorial Flet development workflow optimization Flet 发布准备 AIエージェント工具 Python 实时应用 自动化版本更新 发布过程优化 Flet 项目管理 Git 日志集成 依存关系管理 Increments Flet version numbers based on minor or major release type Updates pubspec.yaml with the new version number Runs pub get to refresh pubspec.lock Generates a new entry in CHANGELOG.md from git log Supports automated release process for Flet apps prepare-flet-release is a skill that automates the Flet release process by incrementing version numbers and updating relevant files, such as pubspec.yaml and CHANGELOG.md.');
