icionar novo cartão de crédito é um processo que permite aos usuários incluir cartões de crédito personalizados no catálogo da aplicação","ru":"Добавление нового кредитного карты - это процесс, который позволяет пользователям добавлять индивидуальные кредитные карты в каталог системы","ar":"إضافة بطاقة ائتمان جديدة هي عملية تمكن المستخدمين من إضافة بطاقات ائتمان مخصصة إلى الفهرس التطبيقي"},"features":{"en":["Gathers card information, including card name and issuer","Creates card templates with benefits","Supports downloading card images","Adds support for new card types","Requires exact official card name and issuer details"],"zh":["支持添加新信用卡到卡片目录","可以创建卡模板和设置卡片优惠","允许下载卡片图片","支持添加新的卡片类型"],"ja":["カードカタログに新規クレジットカードを追加できる","カードテンプレートを作成し、カードの特典を設定できる","カードイメージをダウンロードできる","新しいカードタイプを追加できる"],"ko":["카드 카탈로그에 새로운 신용카드를 추가할 수 있습니다","카드 템플릿을 생성하고 카드 혜택을 설정할 수 있습니다","카드 이미지를 다운로드할 수 있습니다","새로운 카드 유형을 추가할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Gestión de información de tarjetas de crédito","Creación de plantillas de tarjetas con beneficios","Descarga de imágenes de tarjetas","Soporte para nuevos tipos de tarjetas"],"fr":["Gestion des informations de cartes de crédit","Création de modèles de cartes avec avantages","Téléchargement d''images de cartes","Prise en charge de nouveaux types de cartes"],"de":["Verwaltung von Kreditkarteninformationen","Erstellung von Kartenvorlagen mit Vorteilen","Herunterladen von Kartenbildern","Unterstützung für neue Kartenarten"],"pt":["Coleta de informações do cartão","Criação de modelo de cartão com benefícios","Download de imagem do cartão","Adição de suporte para novo tipo de cartão"],"ru":["Сбор информации о карте","Создание шаблона карты с льготами","Загрузка изображения карты","Добавление поддержки нового типа карты"],"ar":["جمع معلومات البطاقة","إنشاء نموذج بطاقة مع فوائد","تحميل صورة البطاقة","إضافة دعم لنوع بطاقة جديد"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use add-new-credit-card","add-new-credit-card setup guide","what is add-new-credit-card","add-new-credit-card alternative","add-new-credit-card vs coupon management","add-new-credit-card install","add-new-credit-card tutorial","couponcycle credit card integration"],"zh":["添加新信用卡","AIエージェント","CouponCycle","卡片目录","卡模板","卡片优惠","下载卡片图片"],"ja":["新規クレジットカード追加","AIエージェント","CouponCycle","カードカタログ","カードテンプレート","カードの特典","カードイメージのダウンロード"],"ko":["신용카드 추가","AI 도구","CouponCycle","카드 카탈로그","카드 템플릿","카드 혜택","카드 이미지를 다운로드"],"es":["agregar tarjeta de crédito","couponcycle","desarrollo de aplicaciones","gestión de tarjetas de crédito","herramientas de desarrollo","integración de pagos"],"fr":["ajouter carte de crédit","couponcycle","développement d''applications","gestion de cartes de crédit","outils de développement","intégration de paiement"],"de":["kreditkarte hinzufügen","couponcycle","anwendungsentwicklung","kreditkartenverwaltung","entwicklungstools","zahlungsintegration"],"pt":["adicionar cartão de crédito","catálogo de cartões","cartão de crédito personalizado","modelo de cartão","download de imagem de cartão","suporte para novo tipo de cartão"],"ru":["добавить кредитный карты","каталог карт","индивидуальная кредитная карта","шаблон карты","загрузка изображения карты","поддержка нового типа карты"],"ar":["إضافة بطاقة ائتمان","فهرس البطاقات","بطاقة ائتمان مخصصة","نموذج بطاقة","تحميل صورة البطاقة","دعم لبطاقة جديدة"]}},"owner":"fantasy-cc","repo":"credit-card-tracker","repoPath":"fantasy-cc/credit-card-tracker","stars":8,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T23:11:27Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-new-credit-card","description":"Add a new credit card to the CouponCycle application with its image and benefits. Use when the user asks to add a new card, create a card template, download a card image, or mentions adding cards like Amex, Chase, Citi to the system.","bodyPreview":"# Add New Credit Card to CouponCycle\n\nThis skill guides you through adding a new credit card to the application''s predefined card catalog.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to add a new credit card to the system\n- User wants to create a card template with benefits\n- User needs to download a card image\n- Adding support for a new card type\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Card Information\n\nBefore adding a card, collect this information:\n\n1. **Card Name** (exact official name)\n2. **Issuer** (American Ex","body":"# Add New Credit Card to CouponCycle\n\nThis skill guides you through adding a new credit card to the application''s predefined card catalog.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to add a new credit card to the system\n- User wants to create a card template with benefits\n- User needs to download a card image\n- Adding support for a new card type\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Gather Card Information\n\nBefore adding a card, collect this information:\n\n1. **Card Name** (exact official name)\n2. **Issuer** (American Express, Chase, Citi, Capital One, etc.)\n3. **Annual Fee**\n4. **Cyclical Benefits** (monthly/quarterly/yearly credits)\n\n**Tip**: Research benefits at [US Credit Card Guide](https://www.uscreditcardguide.com/)\n\n### Step 2: Download Card Image\n\nRun the image download script:\n\n```bash\n# Search Google Images for the card\nnode scripts/download-card-image.js --name \"Card Name\" --list\n\n# Download from best result\nnode scripts/download-card-image.js --name \"Card Name\"\n\n# Or use UseYourCredits.com as source (if available)\nnode scripts/download-card-image.js --name \"Card Name\" --source useyourcredits\n\n# Or download from a specific URL\nnode scripts/download-card-image.js --name \"Card Name\" --url \"https://...\"\n```\n\n**Image Location**: `public/images/cards/{slugified-card-name}.png`\n\n### Step 3: Update Seed File\n\nEdit `prisma/seed.ts` and add the card to the `predefinedCardsData` array:\n\n```typescript\n{\n  name: ''Card Name'',\n  issuer: ''Issuer Name'',\n  annualFee: 595,\n  benefits: [\n    // Monthly benefit example\n    {\n      description: ''$15 Monthly Credit (Service Name)'',\n      category: ''Travel'',\n      maxAmount: 15,\n      frequency: BenefitFrequency.MONTHLY,\n      percentage: 0,\n      cycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CALENDAR_FIXED,\n      occurrencesInCycle: 1,\n    },\n    // Quarterly benefit example\n    {\n      description: ''$100 Quarterly Travel Credit'',\n      category: ''Travel'',\n      maxAmount: 100,\n      frequency: BenefitFrequency.QUARTERLY,\n      percentage: 0,\n      cycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CARD_ANNIVERSARY,\n      occurrencesInCycle: 1,\n    },\n    // Semi-annual benefit (Jan-Jun)\n    {\n      description: ''$250 Hotel Credit (Jan-Jun)'',\n      category: ''Travel'',\n      maxAmount: 250,\n      frequency: BenefitFrequency.YEARLY,\n      percentage: 0,\n      cycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CALENDAR_FIXED,\n      fixedCycleStartMonth: 1,\n      fixedCycleDurationMonths: 6,\n      occurrencesInCycle: 1,\n    },\n    // Semi-annual benefit (Jul-Dec)\n    {\n      description: ''$250 Hotel Credit (Jul-Dec)'',\n      category: ''Travel'',\n      maxAmount: 250,\n      frequency: BenefitFrequency.YEARLY,\n      percentage: 0,\n      cycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CALENDAR_FIXED,\n      fixedCycleStartMonth: 7,\n      fixedCycleDurationMonths: 6,\n      occurrencesInCycle: 1,\n    },\n    // Yearly benefit\n    {\n      description: ''$200 Airline Fee Credit'',\n      category: ''Travel'',\n      maxAmount: 200,\n      frequency: BenefitFrequency.YEARLY,\n      percentage: 0,\n      cycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CALENDAR_FIXED,\n      fixedCycleStartMonth: 1,\n      fixedCycleDurationMonths: 12,\n      occurrencesInCycle: 1,\n    },\n  ],\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply the Seed\n\n```bash\nnpx prisma db seed\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify\n\n```bash\n# List all available cards to verify\nnode scripts/list-available-cards.cjs\n```\n\n## Benefit Categories\n\nUse these standard categories:\n- `Travel` - Airlines, hotels, TSA PreCheck, Uber, Lyft\n- `Dining` - Restaurants, food delivery\n- `Entertainment` - Streaming, events, concerts\n- `Electronics` - Dell, Apple, Best Buy\n- `Wellness` - Equinox, fitness memberships\n- `Software` - Adobe, subscriptions\n- `Business Services` - Professional services\n\n## Benefit Inclusion Criteria\n\n**Include:**\n- Credits that reset on cycles (monthly/quarterly/yearly)\n- Free nights, statement credits, points multipliers with caps\n\n**Exclude:**\n- Lounge memberships (Priority Pass, Centurion)\n- Insurance benefits\n- Earning rate multipliers without caps\n- One-time signup bonuses\n- Elite status benefits\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Calendar-Fixed Monthly\nCredits that reset on the 1st of each month:\n```typescript\ncycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CALENDAR_FIXED,\nfrequency: BenefitFrequency.MONTHLY,\n```\n\n### Card Anniversary Quarterly\nCredits that reset every 3 months from card opening:\n```typescript\ncycleAlignment: BenefitCycleAlignment.CARD_ANNIVERSARY,\nfrequency: BenefitFrequency.QUARTERLY,\n```\n\n### Semi-Annual (Split Year)\nTwo separate benefits, one for each half of the year:\n```typescript\n// First half: Jan-Jun\nfixedCycleStartMonth: 1,\nfixedCycleDurationMonths: 6,\n\n// Second half: Jul-Dec\nfixedCycleStartMonth: 7,\nfixedCycleDurationMonths: 6,\n```\n\n## Image Download Troubleshooting\n\nIf the automatic download fails:\n\n1. **Try UseYourCredits source**: `--source useyourcredits`\n2. **Manual URL**: Find the image manually and use `--url`\n3. **Check slug mapping**: Update `USEYOURCREDITS_SLUGS` in the script\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:50:04.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Agents needing to integrate credit card management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要集成信用卡管理功能的金融代理","ja":"金融エージェントがクレジットカード管理機能を統合する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"금융 에이전트가 신용 카드 관리 기능을 통합해야 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Financieros que necesitan integrar capacidades de gestión de tarjetas de crédito.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents financiers ayant besoin d''intégrer des capacités de gestion de cartes de crédit.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzagenten, die Kreditkarten-Management-Funktionen integrieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Financeiros que precisam integrar capacidades de gerenciamento de cartões de crédito.","ru":"Идеально для финансовых агентов, которым необходимо интегрировать возможности управления кредитными картами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الماليين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج إمكانيات إدارة بطاقات الائتمان."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to collect and process card information, including card names and issuers, facilitating the addition of new credit cards to the application''s catalog using protocols like secure data transmission and handling card image downloads.","zh":"赋予代理商收集和处理卡片信息的能力，包括卡片名称和发行方，方便使用安全数据传输等协议将新信用卡添加到应用程序的目录中，并处理卡片图像下载","ja":"エージェントがカード情報を収集して処理する機能を提供し、カード名や発行元などを含むカード情報の追加や、安全なデータ転送などのプロトコルを使用してカードイメージのダウンロードを容易にします","ko":"에이전트가 카드 정보를 수집하고 처리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 카드 이름과 발급 기관 등을 포함한 카드 정보를 추가하고 안전한 데이터 전송과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 카드 이미지 다운로드를 용이하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a recopilar y procesar información de tarjetas, incluidos los nombres de las tarjetas y los emisores, facilitando la adición de nuevas tarjetas de crédito al catálogo de la aplicación utilizando protocolos como la transmisión de datos segura y el manejo de descargas de imágenes de tarjetas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de collecter et de traiter les informations de cartes, y compris les noms de cartes et les émetteurs, facilitant l''ajout de nouvelles cartes de crédit au catalogue de l''application en utilisant des protocoles tels que la transmission de données sécurisée et la gestion des téléchargements d''images de cartes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Karteninformationen zu sammeln und zu verarbeiten, einschließlich Kartennamen und -ausgebern, was die Hinzufügung neuer Kreditkarten zum Anwendungskatalog unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie sicherer Datenübertragung und Kartenvorlagen-Download erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coletar e processar informações de cartão, incluindo nomes de cartão e emissores, facilitando a adição de novos cartões de crédito ao catálogo da aplicação usando protocolos como transmissão de dados segura e manipulação de downloads de imagens de cartão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью собирать и обрабатывать информацию о карте, включая названия карт и эмитентов, что облегчает добавление новых кредитных карт в каталог приложения с использованием протоколов, таких как безопасная передача данных и обработка загрузки изображений карт.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على جمع ومعالجة معلومات البطاقة ، بما في ذلك أسماء البطاقة والمنظمين ، مما يسهل إضافة بطاقات الائتمان الجديدة إلى فهرس التطبيق باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل نقل البيانات الآمن ومعالجة تنزيلات صور البطاقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new credit card types to the system","Creating card templates with benefits","Downloading card images for user verification","Supporting new card issuers like American Express"],"zh":["将新类型的信用卡添加到系统中","创建具有优惠的卡片模板","下载卡片图像以便用户验证","支持新的卡片发行方，如美国运通"],"ja":["システムに新しいタイプのクレジットカードを追加する","特典付きのカードテンプレートを作成する","ユーザー認証のためにカードイメージをダウンロードする","アメリカンエキスプレスなどの新しいカード発行元をサポートする"],"ko":["시스템에 새로운 유형의 신용 카드를 추가하는 것","특혜가 있는 카드 템플릿을 생성하는 것","사용자 인증을 위해 카드 이미지 다운로드","아메리칸 엑스프레스와 같은 새로운 카드 발급 기관 지원"],"es":["Agregar nuevos tipos de tarjetas de crédito al sistema","Crear plantillas de tarjetas con beneficios","Descargar imágenes de tarjetas para la verificación de usuarios","Soportar nuevos emisores de tarjetas como American Express"],"fr":["Ajouter de nouveaux types de cartes de crédit au système","Créer des modèles de cartes avec des avantages","Télécharger des images de cartes pour la vérification des utilisateurs","Prendre en charge de nouveaux émetteurs de cartes comme American Express"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer Kreditkarten-Typen zum System","Erstellen von Kartenvorlagen mit Vorteilen","Herunterladen von Kartenvorlagen für die Benutzerverifizierung","Unterstützen neuer Kartenemittenten wie American Express"],"pt":["Adicionar novos tipos de cartões de crédito ao sistema","Criar modelos de cartão com benefícios","Baixar imagens de cartão para verificação do usuário","Suportar novos emissores de cartão como o American Express"],"ru":["Добавление новых типов кредитных карт в систему","Создание шаблонов карт с преимуществами","Загрузка изображений карт для проверки пользователя","Поддержка новых эмитентов карт, таких как American Express"],"ar":["إضافة أنواع جديدة من بطاقات الائتمان إلى النظام","إنشاء قوالب بطاقة مع الفوائد","تنزيل صور البطاقة للتحقق من المستخدم","دعم مصدرين جديدين للبطاقات مثل أمريكان إكسبريس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for card information","Dependent on predefined card catalog","Limited to credit card management functionality"],"zh":["需要用户输入卡片信息","依赖于预定义的卡片目录","仅限于信用卡管理功能"],"ja":["カード情報の入力にユーザーの入力が必要","事前に定義されたカードカタログに依存している","クレジットカード管理機能のみに限定"],"ko":["카드 정보 입력에 사용자 입력이 필요","사전에 정의된 카드 카탈로그에 의존","신용 카드 관리 기능만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere la entrada de usuario para la información de la tarjeta","Dependiente del catálogo de tarjetas predefinido","Limitado a la funcionalidad de gestión de tarjetas de crédito"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour les informations de cartes","Dépend du catalogue de cartes prédéfini","Limité à la fonctionnalité de gestion de cartes de crédit"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für Karteninformationen erforderlich","Abhängig vom vordefinierten Kartenkatalog","Begrenzt auf Kreditkarten-Management-Funktionen"],"pt":["Requer entrada de usuário para informações de cartão","Dependente do catálogo de cartão predefinido","Limitado à funcionalidade de gerenciamento de cartões de crédito"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для информации о карте","Зависит от предварительно определенного каталога карт","Ограничен функциональностью управления кредитными картами"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لمعلومات البطاقة","يعتمد على فهرس البطاقة المحدد مسبقا","محدود بالوظيفة لإدارة بطاقات الائتمان"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"718a4d532b274d9a58d8bf82675f2d7a5a6954cdeebc24bd51e507db4ea15b9b","qualityScore":48}');
