INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('EPOCHDevs/ClaudeCodeResearch/build-job-data', 'build-job-data', 'EPOCHDevs', 'ClaudeCodeResearch', 'community', 'build-job-data EPOCHDevs ClaudeCodeResearch community The build-job-data skill generates the `generate_job_data` binary, utilizing file locking to prevent concurrent builds, benefiting developers working with C++ tools. Build Job Data是一种使用文件锁定防止并发构建的技术，支持Release和Debug构建 Build Job Dataは、ファイルロックを使用してコンカレントビルドを防ぐ技術で、リリースビルドとデバッグビルドをサポートしています Build Job Data는 파일 잠금을 사용하여 동시 빌드를 방지하는 기술로 릴리스 빌드 및 디버그 빌드를 지원합니다 Build-job-data es una herramienta que permite la compilación de datos de trabajo con bloqueo de archivos para evitar compilaciones concurrentes. Build-job-data est un outil qui permet la compilation de données de travail avec verrouillage de fichiers pour éviter les compilations concurrentes. Build-job-data ist ein Tool, das die Kompilierung von Arbeitsdaten mit Dateisperre ermöglicht, um gleichzeitige Kompilierungen zu vermeiden. O build-job-data é uma ferramenta que constrói dados de trabalho com flock e AddressSanitizer. Veja como configurá-lo Build-job-data - это инструмент, который создает данные работы с помощью ИИ Агентов, flock и AddressSanitizer. Узнайте, как его настроить build-job-data هو أداة لبناء بيانات الوظيفة مع وكيل إلكتروني و Flock و AddressSanitizer. تعرف على كيفية إعداده how to use build-job-data build-job-data setup guide what is build-job-data build-job-data alternative build-job-data vs concurrent build tools build-job-data install build-job-data flock usage build-job-data AddressSanitizer Build Job Data 文件锁定 AddressSanitizer 构建工具 并发构建 Release构建 Debug构建 AIエージェント Utilizes `flock` for file locking to prevent concurrent builds Supports release builds using `/home/adesola/EpochDev/EpochBackend/build` Supports debug builds with AddressSanitizer via `--asan` flag Executes builds using `/home/adesola/EpochDev/ClaudeCodeResearch/cpp_tools/build_generate_job_data.sh` script Prevents simultaneous build runs, ensuring data integrity Leverages bash scripting for build automation build-job-data is a skill that builds the `generate_job_data` binary with file locking, ensuring exclusive build execution.');
