INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('amo-tech-ai/rocket-path-ai/cicd-pipeline', 'cicd-pipeline', 'amo-tech-ai', 'rocket-path-ai', 'community', 'cicd-pipeline amo-tech-ai rocket-path-ai community The cicd-pipeline skill sets up continuous integration and deployment with GitHub Actions, enabling automated build verification and deployment gates for developers. It streamlines CI/CD workflows from scratch to production deployment. CI/CD 流水线设置指南，使用 GitHub Actions 实现自动化构建、测试和部署 CI/CD パイプライン設定ガイド - GitHub Actions を使用して自動化ビルド、テスト、デプロイメントを実現します CI/CD 파이프라인 설정 가이드 - GitHub Actions를 사용하여 자동화된 빌드, 테스트, 배포를 실현하세요 El pipeline CI/CD permite la integración y entrega continua de código con GitHub Actions. Configura verificación de compilación y despliegue automatizado Le pipeline CI/CD permet l''intégration et le déploiement continus de code avec GitHub Actions. Configurez la vérification de build et le déploiement automatique Die CI/CD-Pipeline ermöglicht die kontinuierliche Integration und Bereitstellung von Code mit GitHub Actions. Konfigurieren Sie die Build-Verifizierung und den automatischen Bereitstellungsprozess Configure um pipeline CI/CD com GitHub Actions para automatizar verificações de build e deploy. Aprenda a usar `.github/workflows/ci.yml` para criar um workflow de CI Настройте конвейер CI/CD с помощью ИИ Агентов и GitHub Actions для автоматизации проверок сборки и развертывания. Узнайте, как использовать `.github/workflows/ci.yml` для создания рабочего процесса CI إعداد трубة CI/CD مع إجراءات GitHub لتحديث التكامل والتحقق من بناء. تعلم كيفية استخدام `.github/workflows/ci.yml` لإنشاء سير عمل CI how to use cicd-pipeline cicd-pipeline setup guide github actions ci cd continuous integration and deployment tutorial cicd-pipeline vs jenkins automated deployment with github actions cicd-pipeline install what is cicd-pipeline cicd-pipeline alternative CI/CD 流水线 GitHub Actions 自动化构建 自动化测试 部署自动化 CI/CD 设置指南 Configures GitHub Actions for continuous integration and deployment Automates build verification using `.github/workflows/ci.yml` files Supports deployment gates for controlled production releases Triggers automated test runs on pull requests and push events Utilizes `ubuntu-latest` environment for build and deployment jobs cicd-pipeline is a skill that automates continuous integration and deployment using GitHub Actions, facilitating build checks, automated test runs, and production deployment automation.');
