["Utilização de UnoCSS para estilização atômica","Criação de padrões de estilo personalizados","Implementação de animações e layouts responsivos","Uso de classes inline para estilização","Customização de cores e tipografia"],"ru":["Использование UnoCSS для атомарной стилизации","Создание пользовательских шаблонов стиля","Реализация анимаций и адаптивных макетов","Использование инлайн-классов для стилизации","Настройка цветов и типографики"],"ar":["استخدام UnoCSS لأسلوب الذري","إنشاء أنماط أسلوب مخصصة","تنفيذ Animations وتصميمات مستجيب","استخدام فئات متضمنة لأسلوب","تخصيص الألوان والخطوط"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use slidev-styling","what is slidev-styling","slidev-styling vs tailwind css","slidev-styling setup guide","slidev-styling install","customizing slidev presentations","UnoCSS tutorial","slidev styling best practices"],"zh":["Slidev样式设置","UnoCSS","自定义CSS","作用域样式","高级样式技术","幻灯片设计","AIエージェント","前端开发"],"ja":["Slidevスタイリング","UnoCSS","カスタムCSS","スコープスタイル","高度なスタイリングテクニック","スライドデザイン","AIエージェント","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["Slidev 스타일링","UnoCSS","커스텀 CSS","스코프 스타일","고급 스타일링 기술","프레젠테이션 디자인","AI 에이전트","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["slidev estilos","unocss","css personalizado","estilismo avanzado","diseño responsivo","animaciones en slidev","como usar unocss en slidev","slidev styling tutorial"],"fr":["style slidev","unocss","css personnalisé","stylisme avancé","conception responsive","animations dans slidev","comment utiliser unocss dans slidev","tutoriel de style slidev"],"de":["slidev stylen","unocss","benutzerdefiniertes css","erweitertes stylen","responsives design","animationen in slidev","wie man unocss in slidev verwendet","slidev-styling-anleitung"],"pt":["slidev styling","UnoCSS","CSS personalizado","estilização atômica","padrões de estilo","animações","layouts responsivos","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Slidev стилизация","UnoCSS","Пользовательский CSS","Атомарная стилизация","Шаблоны стиля","Анимации","Адаптивные макеты","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["تخصيص أسلوب Slidev","UnoCSS","CSS مخصص","أسلوب ذري","أنماط أسلوب","Animations","تصميمات مستجيب","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"szeyu","repo":"open-ssyok-finance","repoPath":"szeyu/open-ssyok-finance","stars":4,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T19:54:03Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slidev-styling","description":"Style Slidev slides with UnoCSS and custom CSS. Use this skill for custom colors, typography, animations, and responsive designs.","bodyPreview":"# Styling in Slidev\n\nThis skill covers all styling options in Slidev, including UnoCSS utilities, custom CSS, scoped styles, and advanced styling techniques.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Customizing slide appearance\n- Adding custom colors and typography\n- Creating reusable style patterns\n- Implementing animations\n- Building responsive layouts\n\n## UnoCSS Basics\n\nSlidev uses UnoCSS, an atomic CSS framework similar to Tailwind CSS.\n\n### Inline Classes\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"text-xl font-bold tex","body":"# Styling in Slidev\n\nThis skill covers all styling options in Slidev, including UnoCSS utilities, custom CSS, scoped styles, and advanced styling techniques.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Customizing slide appearance\n- Adding custom colors and typography\n- Creating reusable style patterns\n- Implementing animations\n- Building responsive layouts\n\n## UnoCSS Basics\n\nSlidev uses UnoCSS, an atomic CSS framework similar to Tailwind CSS.\n\n### Inline Classes\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-500\">\n  Styled text\n</div>\n```\n\n### Common Utilities\n\n**Typography**:\n```markdown\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Small</span>\n<span class=\"text-base\">Base</span>\n<span class=\"text-lg\">Large</span>\n<span class=\"text-xl\">Extra Large</span>\n<span class=\"text-2xl\">2XL</span>\n\n<span class=\"font-bold\">Bold</span>\n<span class=\"font-semibold\">Semibold</span>\n<span class=\"italic\">Italic</span>\n<span class=\"underline\">Underlined</span>\n```\n\n**Colors**:\n```markdown\n<span class=\"text-red-500\">Red text</span>\n<span class=\"text-blue-600\">Blue text</span>\n<span class=\"bg-green-100\">Green background</span>\n<span class=\"bg-yellow-200 text-yellow-800\">Yellow combo</span>\n```\n\n**Spacing**:\n```markdown\n<div class=\"p-4\">Padding 4</div>\n<div class=\"m-2\">Margin 2</div>\n<div class=\"px-4 py-2\">Horizontal/Vertical padding</div>\n<div class=\"mt-8\">Margin top 8</div>\n```\n\n**Layout**:\n```markdown\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n  <span>Left</span>\n  <span>Right</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n  <div>Column 1</div>\n  <div>Column 2</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Color System\n\n### Default Colors\n\n```markdown\n<!-- Grays -->\n<span class=\"text-gray-100\">100</span>\n<span class=\"text-gray-500\">500</span>\n<span class=\"text-gray-900\">900</span>\n\n<!-- Colors -->\n<span class=\"text-red-500\">Red</span>\n<span class=\"text-orange-500\">Orange</span>\n<span class=\"text-yellow-500\">Yellow</span>\n<span class=\"text-green-500\">Green</span>\n<span class=\"text-blue-500\">Blue</span>\n<span class=\"text-purple-500\">Purple</span>\n<span class=\"text-pink-500\">Pink</span>\n```\n\n### Custom Colors\n\nIn `uno.config.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from ''unocss''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  theme: {\n    colors: {\n      brand: {\n        DEFAULT: ''#5d8392'',\n        light: ''#8bb4c4'',\n        dark: ''#3d5a65'',\n      },\n      accent: ''#f59e0b'',\n    },\n  },\n})\n```\n\nUsage:\n```markdown\n<span class=\"text-brand\">Brand color</span>\n<span class=\"bg-brand-light\">Light brand background</span>\n<span class=\"text-accent\">Accent color</span>\n```\n\n## Typography\n\n### Font Sizes\n\n```markdown\n<p class=\"text-xs\">Extra small (12px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm\">Small (14px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-base\">Base (16px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-lg\">Large (18px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-xl\">XL (20px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-2xl\">2XL (24px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-3xl\">3XL (30px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-4xl\">4XL (36px)</p>\n<p class=\"text-5xl\">5XL (48px)</p>\n```\n\n### Custom Fonts\n\nIn frontmatter:\n\n```yaml\n---\nfonts:\n  sans: ''Inter''\n  serif: ''Merriweather''\n  mono: ''Fira Code''\n---\n```\n\nIn `uno.config.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineConfig({\n  theme: {\n    fontFamily: {\n      display: [''Inter'', ''sans-serif''],\n      body: [''Open Sans'', ''sans-serif''],\n    },\n  },\n})\n```\n\nUsage:\n```markdown\n<h1 class=\"font-display\">Display heading</h1>\n<p class=\"font-body\">Body text</p>\n```\n\n### Google Fonts\n\n```yaml\n---\nfonts:\n  sans: ''Roboto''\n  serif: ''Playfair Display''\n  mono: ''JetBrains Mono''\n  provider: ''google''\n---\n```\n\n## Global Styles\n\n### styles/index.css\n\n```css\n/* styles/index.css */\n\n/* Root variables */\n:root {\n  --color-primary: #3b82f6;\n  --color-secondary: #10b981;\n  --font-size-base: 16px;\n}\n\n/* Global typography */\n.slidev-layout h1 {\n  font-size: 2.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-primary);\n}\n\n.slidev-layout h2 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-secondary);\n}\n\n/* Custom utility classes */\n.highlight {\n  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #84fab0 0%, #8fd3f4 100%);\n  padding: 0 0.25em;\n}\n\n.shadow-brand {\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px 0 rgba(93, 131, 146, 0.39);\n}\n\n/* Animation classes */\n.fade-in {\n  animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; }\n  to { opacity: 1; }\n}\n```\n\n## Scoped Styles\n\n### Per-Slide Styles\n\nAdd `<style>` at the end of a slide:\n\n```markdown\n# My Styled Slide\n\n<div class=\"custom-box\">\n  Special content\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.custom-box {\n  padding: 2rem;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n  border-radius: 1rem;\n  color: white;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: #667eea;\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n}\n</style>\n```\n\n### Scoped vs Global\n\nStyles in `<style>` are automatically scoped to the slide.\n\nFor global styles within a slide:\n```markdown\n<style>\n:global(.slidev-layout) {\n  /* Affects all slides */\n}\n</style>\n```\n\n## Layout Utilities\n\n### Flexbox\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n  <div>Item 1</div>\n  <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center h-full\">\n  <p>Centered content</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n  <span class=\"badge\">Tag 1</span>\n  <span class=\"badge\">Tag 2</span>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Grid\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n  <div>1</div>\n  <div>2</div>\n  <div>3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n  <!-- Responsive grid -->\n</div>\n```\n\n### Positioning\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"relative\">\n  <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0\">\n    Top right corner\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"fixed bottom-4 right-4\">\n  Fixed position\n</div>\n```\n\n## Custom Shortcuts\n\n### In uno.config.ts\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from ''unocss''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  shortcuts: {\n    ''btn'': ''px-4 py-2 rounded bg-blue-500 text-white hover:bg-blue-600'',\n    ''btn-outline'': ''px-4 py-2 rounded border border-blue-500 text-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-50'',\n    ''card'': ''p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md bg-white dark:bg-gray-800'',\n    ''section-title'': ''text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4'',\n    ''badge'': ''px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-800'',\n  },\n})\n```\n\nUsage:\n```markdown\n<button class=\"btn\">Click me</button>\n<div class=\"card\">Card content</div>\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Section</h2>\n```\n\n## Dark Mode Styling\n\n### Dark Mode Classes\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n  Adapts to dark mode\n</div>\n```\n\n### In Custom CSS\n\n```css\n.my-component {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n\n.dark .my-component {\n  background: #1a1a1a;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n```\n\n## Animations\n\n### Transition Utilities\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110\">\n  Scales on hover\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-blue-500\">\n  Color transition\n</div>\n```\n\n### Custom Animations\n\n```css\n/* styles/index.css */\n@keyframes slideInLeft {\n  from {\n    transform: translateX(-100%);\n    opacity: 0;\n  }\n  to {\n    transform: translateX(0);\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-slide-in-left {\n  animation: slideInLeft 0.5s ease-out;\n}\n```\n\n### Animation with v-motion\n\n```markdown\n<div\n  v-motion\n  :initial=\"{ opacity: 0, y: 50 }\"\n  :enter=\"{ opacity: 1, y: 0, transition: { duration: 500 } }\"\n>\n  Animated content\n</div>\n```\n\n## Responsive Design\n\n### Breakpoints\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg\">\n  Responsive text size\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n  Responsive grid\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hidden lg:block\">\n  Only visible on large screens\n</div>\n```\n\n### Default Breakpoints\n\n| Prefix | Width |\n|--------|-------|\n| `sm` | 640px |\n| `md` | 768px |\n| `lg` | 1024px |\n| `xl` | 1280px |\n| `2xl` | 1536px |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Card Component\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"p-6 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-lg\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Card Title</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">Card content</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Badge\n\n```markdown\n<span class=\"px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-800\">\n  Active\n</span>\n```\n\n### Alert Box\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400\">\n  <p class=\"text-yellow-700\">Warning message</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Code Annotation\n\n```markdown\n<div class=\"relative\">\n\n```js\nconst x = 1 // [!code highlight]\n```\n\n<div class=\"absolute right-4 top-4 text-xs text-gray-500\">\n  Important line!\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Use Utilities First\n\n```markdown\n<!-- Prefer utilities -->\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded\">\n  Good\n</div>\n\n<!-- Custom CSS only when necessary -->\n```\n\n### 2. Create Shortcuts for Repeated Patterns\n\n```typescript\nshortcuts: {\n  ''btn-primary'': ''px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-blue-600'',\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Maintain Consistency\n\nUse the same spacing scale:\n- `gap-4` everywhere, not mixing `gap-3` and `gap-5`\n\n### 4. Support Dark Mode\n\nAlways provide dark mode variants for custom styles.\n\n### 5. Test Export\n\nSome CSS features don''t export well to PDF:\n- Complex gradients\n- Some filters\n- Animations (become static)\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen styling slides:\n\n```markdown\n# [Slide Title]\n\n<div class=\"[utility classes]\">\n  Content\n</div>\n\n<style>\n/* Scoped styles if needed */\n.custom-class {\n  property: value;\n}\n</style>\n```\n\n**STYLE DECISIONS:**\n- Colors: [primary, secondary]\n- Typography: [font choices]\n- Spacing: [consistent scale]\n- Custom shortcuts: [list]\n\n**FILES MODIFIED:**\n- uno.config.ts (shortcuts, theme)\n- styles/index.css (global styles)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:58:25.744Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Presentation Agents requiring advanced Slidev customization capabilities with UnoCSS and custom CSS.","zh":"适用于需要高级Slidev自定义能力的UnoCSS和自定义CSS的演示文档代理。","ja":"UnoCSSとカスタムCSSの高度なスライド カスタマイズ機能を必要とするプレゼンテーション エージェントに最適です。","ko":"UnoCSS 및 사용자 지정 CSS와 같은 고급 Slidev 사용자 정의 기능을 필요로 하는 프레젠테이션 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Presentación que requieren capacidades de personalización avanzadas de Slidev con UnoCSS y CSS personalizado.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Présentation nécessitant des capacités de personnalisation avancées de Slidev avec UnoCSS et CSS personnalisé.","de":"Ideal für Präsentationsagenten, die erweiterte Anpassungsfunktionen für Slidev mit UnoCSS und benutzerdefiniertem CSS benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Apresentação que exigem capacidades de personalização avançadas do Slidev com UnoCSS e CSS personalizado.","ru":"Идеально для Представительских Агентов, требующих расширенных возможностей настройки Slidev с UnoCSS и пользовательским CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء العرض الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات مخصصة متقدمة من Slidev مع UnoCSS و CSS مخصص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create engaging and responsive slide layouts using UnoCSS utilities, custom CSS, and advanced styling techniques, enabling the implementation of animations, reusable style patterns, and responsive designs.","zh":"赋予代理创建吸引人和响应式幻灯片布局的能力，使用UnoCSS实用程序、自定义CSS和高级样式技术，实现动画、可重用样式模式和响应式设计的实现。","ja":"UnoCSSユーティリティ、カスタムCSS、先進的なスタイリング技術を使用して、エージェントが魅力的でレスポンシブなスライド レイアウトを作成できるようにし、アニメーション、再利用可能なスタイル パターン、レスポンシブ デザインの実装を可能にします。","ko":"UnoCSS 유틸리티, 사용자 지정 CSS 및 고급 스타일링 기술을 사용하여 에이전트가 매력적이고 반응형 슬라이드 레이아웃을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 애니메이션, 재사용 가능한 스타일 패턴 및 반응형 디자인의 구현을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños de diapositivas atractivos y responsivos utilizando utilidades de UnoCSS, CSS personalizado y técnicas de estilo avanzadas, lo que permite la implementación de animaciones, patrones de estilo reutilizables y diseños responsivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des mises en page de diapositives engageantes et responsives en utilisant les utilitaires UnoCSS, le CSS personnalisé et les techniques de style avancées, ce qui permet la mise en œuvre d''animations, de modèles de style réutilisables et de conceptions responsives.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ansprechende und responsive Slides-Layouts mit UnoCSS-Utilities, benutzerdefiniertem CSS und erweiterten Stiltechniken zu erstellen, wodurch die Implementierung von Animationen, wiederverwendbaren Stilmustern und responsiven Designs ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem layouts de slide atraentes e responsivos usando utilitários UnoCSS, CSS personalizado e técnicas de estilização avançadas, permitindo a implementação de animações, padrões de estilo reutilizáveis e designs responsivos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные и отзывчивые макеты слайдов с помощью утилит UnoCSS, пользовательского CSS и продвинутых методов стилизации, что позволяет реализовать анимации, повторно используемые шаблоны стиля и адаптивный дизайн.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تخطيطات شريحة جذابة ومتجاوبة باستخدام أدوات UnoCSS و CSS مخصصة وتقنيات تنسيق متقدمة، مما يمكّن من تنفيذ Animations ونماذج أسلوب قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وتصاميم متجاوبة"},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing slide appearances with UnoCSS classes","Implementing animations and interactive elements in Slidev presentations","Building responsive and reusable slide layouts"],"zh":["使用UnoCSS类自定义幻灯片外观","在Slidev演示文稿中实现动画和交互元素","构建响应式和可重用幻灯片布局"],"ja":["UnoCSSクラスを使用してスライドの外観をカスタマイズする","Slidevプレゼンテーションでアニメーションとインタラクティブ要素を実装する","レスポンシブで再利用可能なスライド レイアウトを構築する"],"ko":["UnoCSS 클래스를 사용하여 슬라이드의 외観을 사용자 지정하는 것","Slidev 프레젠테이션에서 애니메이션 및 상호 작용 요소를 구현하는 것","반응형 및 재사용 가능한 슬라이드 레이아웃을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Personalizar la apariencia de las diapositivas con clases de UnoCSS","Implementar animaciones y elementos interactivos en presentaciones de Slidev","Crear diseños de diapositivas responsivos y reutilizables"],"fr":["Personnaliser l''apparence des diapositives avec des classes UnoCSS","Mettre en œuvre des animations et des éléments interactifs dans les présentations Slidev","Créer des mises en page de diapositives responsives et réutilisables"],"de":["Anpassen des Slides-Erscheinungsbildes mit UnoCSS-Klassen","Implementierung von Animationen und interaktiven Elementen in Slidev-Präsentationen","Erstellen responsiver und wiederverwendbarer Slides-Layouts"],"pt":["Personalizar apariências de slide com classes UnoCSS","Implementar animações e elementos interativos em apresentações do Slidev","Construir layouts de slide responsivos e reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Настройка внешнего вида слайда с помощью классов UnoCSS","Реализация анимаций и интерактивных элементов в презентациях Slidev","Создание отзывчивых и повторно используемых макетов слайдов"],"ar":["تخصيص مظهر الشريحة باستخدام فئات UnoCSS","تنفيذ Animations و العناصر التفاعلية في عروض Slidev","بناء تخطيطات شريحة متجاوبة وقابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of UnoCSS and CSS","Limited to Slidev presentations"],"zh":["需要UnoCSS和CSS的知识","仅限Slidev演示文稿"],"ja":["UnoCSSとCSSの知識が必要","Slidevプレゼンテーションのみ"],"ko":["UnoCSS 및 CSS에 대한 지식이 필요함","Slidev 프레젠테이션만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de UnoCSS y CSS","Limitado a presentaciones de Slidev"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en UnoCSS et CSS","Limité aux présentations Slidev"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von UnoCSS und CSS","Begrenzt auf Slidev-Präsentationen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de UnoCSS e CSS","Limitado a apresentações do Slidev"],"ru":["Требует знаний UnoCSS и CSS","Ограничен презентациями Slidev"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة UnoCSS و CSS","محدود بعروض Slidev"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a738a46f1336450ce7241af293367449c95c33f4a43e0f61291904e0e54d5f32","qualityScore":48}');
