INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('adscorp100/mdhomecarebuild/experiment-loop', 'experiment-loop', 'adscorp100', 'mdhomecarebuild', 'community', 'experiment-loop adscorp100 mdhomecarebuild community The experiment-loop skill tracks content changes, measures their impact on traffic and rankings, and decides whether to keep, iterate, or revert. It''s designed for MD Home Care and runs weekly. 实验循环是一种AIエージェント工具，用于跟踪内容变化，衡量其对流量和排名的影响，并决定是否保留、迭代或恢复 実験ループは，コンテンツの変更を追跡し，その影響を評価し，保持，改良，または復元することを決定するAIエージェントツールです 실험 루프는 웹사이트의 콘텐츠 변화를 추적하고 그 영향력을 평가하여 유지, 개선 또는 되돌리기 위한 결정에 도움을 주는 AI 에이전트 도구입니다 Experiment Loop es una herramienta que analiza los cambios en el contenido y mide su impacto en el tráfico y los rankings. Se ejecuta semanalmente Experiment Loop est un outil qui analyse les changements de contenu et mesure leur impact sur le trafic et les classements. Il s''exécute hebdomadairement Experiment Loop ist ein Tool, das Änderungen im Content analysiert und deren Auswirkungen auf den Traffik und die Rankings misst. Es wird wöchentlich ausgeführt O experiment-loop é uma ferramenta que ajuda a otimizar o conteúdo do site, medindo o impacto das mudanças em tráfego e classificações de SEO. Experiment-Loop - это инструмент, который помогает оптимизировать контент сайта, измеряя влияние изменений на трафик и рейтинги в поисковых системах. تجربة حلقة هي أداة تساعد في تحسين محتوى الموقع، بقياس تأثير التغييرات على حركة المرور والتصنيفات how to use experiment-loop what is experiment-loop experiment-loop alternative experiment-loop vs other optimization tools experiment-loop install experiment-loop setup guide MD Home Care optimization YMYL content optimization SEO lag times AEO lag times 实验循环 AIエージェント 流量优化 SEO最適化 YMYL内容 延迟评估 评估窗口 网站排名 Tracks content changes and measures their impact on traffic and rankings Decides whether to keep, iterate, or revert changes based on evaluation windows Accounts for lag times in YMYL content, such as aged care and disability services Runs weekly to ensure consistent optimization Evaluates changes based on SEO and AEO lag times, with windows of 3-7 days experiment-loop is a weekly process that tracks content changes, measures their impact, and optimizes traffic and rankings for MD Home Care');
